---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
import { book } from "../data/book";

const schema = [
  {
    "@type": "Book",
    "@id": `${site.domain}/book`,
    name: book.title,
    author: { "@id": `${site.domain}/#katherine` },
    url: `${site.domain}/book`,
    sameAs: book.url,
    image: new URL(book.cover, site.domain).href,
    description: book.description,
    isbn: book.isbn13,
    numberOfPages: book.pages,
    bookFormat: "https://schema.org/Paperback",
    inLanguage: "en-US",
    datePublished: book.published,
    publisher: { "@type": "Organization", name: book.publisher },
    aggregateRating: {
      "@type": "AggregateRating",
      ratingValue: book.ratingValue,
      ratingCount: book.ratingCount,
      bestRating: 5,
    },
  },
];
---

<Base
  title="Weight Of Dysfunction"
  description="Katherine L. Carter's book is a journal account of a woman in an abusive marriage between 1981 and 1992 — a true record, published so somebody else might recognise their own situation in it."
  image={book.cover}
  schema={schema}
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="shell hero-grid">
      <div class="cover-wrap">
        <img
          class="cover"
          src={book.cover}
          alt={`Cover of ${book.title} by ${book.author}`}
          width="667"
          height="1000"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="kicker">A true account</p>
        <h1>{book.title}</h1>
        <p class="byline">by {book.author}</p>

        <p class="stand">
          A woman's journal from inside an abusive marriage, kept from{" "}
          <strong>1981 to 1992</strong>. Not a memoir written at a safe
          distance — the entries as they were made, while it was still
          happening.
        </p>

        <div
          class="rating"
          aria-label={`Rated ${book.ratingValue} out of 5 from ${book.ratingCount} ratings on Amazon`}
        >
          <span class="stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span>
          <span class="tnum">{book.ratingValue.toFixed(1)} on Amazon</span>
          <span class="dim tnum">({book.ratingCount} ratings)</span>
        </div>

        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-gold" href={book.url} rel="noopener">
            Buy the paperback
          </a>
          <a class="btn btn-quiet" href="/harbor-of-hope">If this is your life</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="quote-sec">
    <div class="shell">
      <blockquote>
        <p>{book.pullQuote}</p>
        <cite>Katherine L. Carter, on why she published it</cite>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-book">
    <div class="shell about-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="rule"><h2>What it is</h2></div>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>
            Eleven years, chronicled as they happened. A true accounting of
            events from one woman's perspective, with some names omitted or
            changed.
          </p>
          <p>
            She had been with her abuser since her early teens. He was the only
            man in her life — <em>her sun, moon and stars</em>. She tries hard.
            She wants to make it work. That is the part the book refuses to
            simplify, and the reason it is difficult to read.
          </p>
          <p>
            Readers who have never been near it arrive with one question.
            Katherine puts it in the description herself rather than waiting for
            somebody else to ask:
          </p>
        </div>

        <blockquote class="inline-quote">
          <p>{book.secondQuote}</p>
        </blockquote>

        <div class="prose">
          <p>
            People stay, and make excuses for the people hurting them, for
            reasons of their own. The book is written for the reader who might
            recognise something of their own life in it — and, in recognising
            it, be able to name it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="facts">
        <h2>The details</h2>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>Publisher</dt><dd>{book.publisher}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Published</dt><dd class="tnum">{book.publishedLabel}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Format</dt><dd>{book.format}, {book.pages} pages</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Language</dt><dd>{book.language}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>ISBN-13</dt><dd class="tnum">{book.isbn13}</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <a class="btn btn-quiet full" href={book.url} rel="noopener">
          View on Amazon
        </a>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="safety">
    <div class="shell note">
      <h2>Before you start</h2>
      <p>
        This book describes domestic abuse in detail. If you are living
        something similar, read it when you have room to — and know that help
        exists, is free, and is there at any hour.
      </p>
      <p class="line">
        <strong>
          National Domestic Violence Hotline —{" "}
          <a href="tel:18007997233">1-800-799-7233</a>
        </strong>, or text START to 88788.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/harbor-of-hope">Harbor of Hope</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="author">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="rule"><h2>How it came to be written</h2></div>
      <div class="prose author-prose">
        {book.bioParagraphs.map((p) => <p>{p}</p>)}
      </div>
      <p class="more">
        <a class="btn btn-quiet" href="/about">More about Katherine</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="onward">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="rule"><h2>If the book resonates</h2></div>
      <div class="cards">
        <a class="card" href="/topics#safety-respect">
          <h3>Safety and respect</h3>
          <p>Where a hard relationship ends and an unsafe one begins — and how to tell.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/blog/control-signs">
          <h3>Early signs of control</h3>
          <p>It rarely announces itself. It arrives looking like love.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/episodes">
          <h3>The Haven</h3>
          <p>Katherine's weekly show, live with an audience that talks back.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: clamp(40px, 6vw, 76px) clamp(28px, 4vw, 48px);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: -20% -10% auto -20%;
    height: 130%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 28% 40%, #3d245640 0%, transparent 62%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero-grid {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr;
    gap: clamp(30px, 5vw, 70px);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .cover-wrap { position: relative; }
  .cover {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 667 / 1000;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 3px;
    box-shadow:
      0 2px 0 0 #ffffff14,
      0 34px 70px -24px #000,
      0 10px 26px -12px #000c;
    transform: rotate(-1.4deg);
  }

  .kicker { color: var(--gold-lit); font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(36px, 5.6vw, 62px); }
  .byline {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(19px, 2.2vw, 23px);
    color: var(--pearl-dim);
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .stand {
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.9vw, 20px);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--pearl);
    margin-top: 22px;
    max-width: 46ch;
  }
  .rating {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 15.5px;
    color: var(--pearl-dim);
  }
  .stars { color: var(--gold-lit); letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 17px; }
  .rating .dim { color: var(--pearl-faint); }
  .actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 26px; }

  .quote-sec { padding-block: clamp(30px, 5vw, 56px); }
  blockquote { margin: 0; max-width: 60ch; }
  blockquote p {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-size: clamp(23px, 3.2vw, 34px);
    line-height: 1.32;
    color: var(--pearl);
    font-style: italic;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--gold);
    padding-left: clamp(18px, 3vw, 30px);
  }
  cite {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding-left: clamp(20px, 3vw, 32px);
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--pearl-faint);
  }
  .inline-quote { margin: 26px 0; }
  .inline-quote p { font-size: clamp(18px, 2.1vw, 22px); }

  .about-book { background: var(--night-sunk); }
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 300px;
    gap: clamp(30px, 5vw, 62px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .prose { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; max-width: 62ch; }
  .prose p { font-size: 17.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #ded7cd; }
  .prose em { color: var(--pearl); font-style: italic; }

  .facts {
    background: var(--night-raised);
    border: 1px solid #2f2438;
    border-radius: var(--r-md);
    padding: 24px 26px;
  }
  .facts h2 { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .facts dl { margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 13px; }
  .facts dt {
    font-family: var(--f-body);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--pearl-faint);
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .facts dd { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: var(--pearl); }
  .full { margin-top: 22px; width: 100%; justify-content: center; }

  .note {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--live);
    background: #e4574f14;
    padding: 26px 30px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .note h2 { font-size: 24px; }
  .note p { color: var(--pearl-dim); max-width: 62ch; }
  .note .line { color: var(--pearl); }
  .note a[href^="tel"] { color: var(--gold-lit); }
  .note .btn { margin-top: 6px; }

  .author-prose { max-width: 66ch; }
  .more { margin-top: 26px; }

  .cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 26px;
  }
  .card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--plum);
    transition: border-color .18s ease;
  }
  .card:hover { border-top-color: var(--gold); }
  .card:hover h3 { color: var(--gold-lit); }
  .card p { color: var(--pearl-dim); font-size: 16px; }

  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cover-wrap { max-width: 230px; }
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
